<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA sorghum export sales highlights in latest report week:</p>
<p>Sales of 84,700 MT were seven and one-fifth times the previous week and two-thirds above the 4-week average.  Turkey (36,000 MT), Japan (24,500 MT), and Mexico (14,200 MT) were the major buyers.</p>
<p>Exports of 142,100 MT--a marketing-year high--were 96 percent above the prior week and 45 percent greater than the 4-week average.  The major destination was Japan (65,900 MT).</p>
</text>
